inoperative when slats/flaps are extended.</para></entry><entry/></row><row lid="N.00008989.0001001.104"><entry valign="middle"><row-header layer="1" lid="N.00008989.0001001.105"><abb>ECAM</abb></row-header><row-header layer="1" lid="N.00008989.0001001.106">(in flight and on
ground)</row-header></entry><entry colsep="1" nameend="col3" namest="col2"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008989.0001001.107">For <tech-label type="s-page">WHEEL</tech-label> and <abb>ECAM</abb> alert <duref product="MMEL" ref="00008988"/> "<abb>ECAM</abb>" line.</para></entry></row></tbody></tgroup></table></inform></procbody></procitem></opsproc>